// Embeds Demo\Sample.pas (the Options-page live-preview source) as RCDATA.
// YADF.OptionsFrame seeds %APPDATA%\YADF\Sample.pas from it on first use, so no
// copy ships beside YADFOT.bpl / YADFSetup.exe. Rebuild after editing the demo:
//   pwsh sync_version.ps1  (re-stamps line 1, runs brcc32; test_sample_resource.ps1 catches drift)
YADF_SAMPLE RCDATA "Demo\\Sample.pas"
